{"seq":1,"slug":"educational-research-methods","title":"教育研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"教育研究方法-简介\">教育研究方法 简介</h1><p>教育研究方法是教育学研究生开展学术研究的方法论基础。教育现象的复杂性和情境依赖性使得教育研究需要兼顾多种方法论取向，从严格的量化实验到深入的质性探究，从宏观的数据分析到微观的课堂观察。</p>\n<p>本课程从研究设计的基本范式出发，分别深入量化和质性两条研究路径，最终聚焦于教育数据分析的前沿技术，共设四个章节。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>教育研究设计</strong>介绍三种具有教育学科特色的研究范式。行动研究将实践改进与知识生产融为一体，设计研究在迭代优化中发展教育理论，个案研究法则通过深度描述来揭示教育现象的丰富性。这些范式反映了教育研究服务于实践改进的学科取向。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>教育量化研究</strong>覆盖教育领域中最常用的定量方法。教育测量理论为评估学生学习提供信效度保障，调查法是大规模教育研究的标准数据收集手段，准实验设计在无法随机分配的教育情境中实现因果推断。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>教育质性研究</strong>深入三种在教育领域应用广泛的质性方法。教育民族志通过长期浸入来理解教育文化和社会过程，叙事探究关注教育经验的意义建构，扎根理论从原始数据中系统地建构教育理论。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>教育数据分析</strong>介绍教育研究中的高级分析技术。多层分析处理学生嵌套于班级和学校的典型数据结构，项目反应理论为教育测评提供精细化的心理计量模型，学习分析则利用数字化学习环境中的过程数据揭示学习行为的模式。</p>\n<p>建议学习者根据自己的研究兴趣选择一到两种核心方法深入掌握，同时了解其他方法以便在跨方法论对话中保持开放性。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"research-design","title":"教育研究设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/research-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"action-research","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 行动研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/research-design/action-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-based-research","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 设计研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/research-design/design-based-research"},{"seq":3,"slug":"case-study-method","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 个案研究法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/research-design/case-study-method"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantitative-methods","title":"教育量化研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/quantitative-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"educational-measurement","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 教育测量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/quantitative-methods/educational-measurement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"survey-methods-edu","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 教育调查法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/quantitative-methods/survey-methods-edu"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quasi-experimental-design","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 准实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/quantitative-methods/quasi-experimental-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"qualitative-methods","title":"教育质性研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/qualitative-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ethnography-education","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 教育民族志","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/qualitative-methods/ethnography-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"narrative-inquiry","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 叙事探究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/qualitative-methods/narrative-inquiry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grounded-theory-edu","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 扎根理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/qualitative-methods/grounded-theory-edu"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-analysis","title":"教育数据分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/data-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multilevel-analysis-edu","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 教育多层分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/data-analysis/multilevel-analysis-edu"},{"seq":2,"slug":"item-response-theory","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 项目反应理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/data-analysis/item-response-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"learning-analytics","title":"研究生 教育研究方法 — 学习分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/educational-research-methods/data-analysis/learning-analytics"}]}]}